// Script Variable Greeting :
"P4025129438" "No further, {HeroName}, without proper clearance.  Let's see some ID."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P3765709821" "Step over here, {HeroName}.  I need to check your clearance."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P3756021407" "I'm the Vanguard Security Officer, {HeroName}.  You need to come talk to me."
// Script Variable RestrictedText :
"P4036853601" "You shouldn't be here, {VillainName}."
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P864263670" "{HeroName}.  Here's the deal.  We have a major situation on our hands.  The Rikti are back in full force and the Crash Site has been closed off.  The only way in or out is via a Vanguard mandated teleporter.<br><br>Think you know what you're getting into?  You don't.  It's a War Zone.  We need all the help we could get fighting off the Rikti, so old enemies are now your allies.  That's right.  It's not just you in there, the Villains from the Rogue Isles will be helping you out.<br><br>Before you get any idea of enacting some revenge on any petty issues you might have with them, give 'em up.  You can't fight them.  We've all had to make some serious sacrifices in light of the second invasion.  Now is the time to stand together and fight back the Rikti.  <br><br>Get in there and make me proud."
// Script Variable OutLoudInfoText :
"P2081373148" "<em=lecture><em=none>"
// Script Variable Leave :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// DisplayName for N_RWZ_Info :
"P4205205694" "Vanguard Security Officer"

