"P2475141574" "{HeroName}.  Here's the deal. We have a major situation on our hands.  The Rikti are back in full force and the Crash Site has been closed off.  It's a war zone now.  <br><br>The only way in or out is via a Vanguard mandated teleporter located in <color orange>Atlas Park</color>, <color orange>Founders Falls</color>, or here in Peregrine Island near the Ferry.  If you're Security Level 35 or above and are interested in helping us, head to one of those locations.<br><br>Oh, and if you haven't already heard, you'll be fighting alongside Villains.  Keep any ideas of revenge to yourself.  You need to focus.  We have a greater threat on our hands right now.<br><br>That is all."
// Script Variable Leave :
// DisplayName for N_RWZ_Info :

